      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, the commit-pinned reproduction, the SoulMate creation trace, and bytecode at the pre-deployment, deployment, and pre-exploit boundaries. The helper calls selector 0x7bde82f2 twice directly on SoulMate, passing the helper as receiver; the target performs no delegatecall. The runtime appears in the recorded creation transaction and remains hash-identical through the block before the exploit. The trace establishes the exact final attacker receipt of 134.517429177775527250 ETH after the stolen basket was sold and the builder was paid."
